msgstr "Egen Utsöökmetood"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:393
msgid "Design your own selection mode!"
msgstr "Dien egen Utsöökmetood opstellen"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:405
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Enkelheiten"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:412
msgid "Double-click selects (classic)"
msgstr "Dubbelklick söcht ut (klass'sch)"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:412
msgid "A single click on a file will select and focus, a double click opens the file or steps into the directory."
msgstr "En Enkelklick op en Datei sett den Blinker dor op un söcht ehr ut, en Dubbelklick maakt de Datei oder den Orner op."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:413
msgid "Obey KDE's global selection policy"
msgstr "KDE sien globaal Utsöökregel bruken"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:413
msgid ""
"<p>Use KDE's global setting:</p>"
"<p><i>KDE System Settings -> General -> Computer Administration -> Keyboard & Mouse -> Mouse</i></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE sien globale Instellen bruken:</p>"
"<p><i>KDE-Systeeminstellen -> Allmeen -> Systeempleeg -> Tastatuur un Muus -> Muus</i></p>"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:424
msgid "Based on KDE's selection mode"
msgstr "Op KDE sien Utsöökmetood opbuut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:425
msgid "If checked, use a mode based on KDE's style."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, en Metood bruken, de op KDE sien Metood opbuut."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:427
msgid "Left mouse button selects"
msgstr "Linke Muusknoop söcht ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:428
msgid "If checked, left clicking an item will select it."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Linksklick en Indrag ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:430
msgid "Left mouse button preserves selection"
msgstr "Linke Muusknoop wohrt Köör"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:431
msgid "If checked, left clicking an item will select it, but will not unselect other, already selected items."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Linksklick en Indrag ut, man köört dor keen anner, al utsöcht Indrääg bi af."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:433
msgid "Shift/Ctrl-Left mouse button selects"
msgstr "Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast un linke Muustast söcht ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:434
msgid ""
"If checked, shift/ctrl left clicking will select items. \n"
"Note: This is meaningless if 'Left Button Selects' is checked."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Indrääg bi daalhollen Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast mit en Linksklick utsöcht.\n"
"Beacht: Dit deit nix, wenn \"Linke Muusknoop söcht ut\" anmaakt is."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:436
msgid "Right mouse button selects"
msgstr "Rechte Muusknoop söcht ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:437
msgid "If checked, right clicking an item will select it."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Rechtsklick en Indrag ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:439
msgid "Right mouse button preserves selection"
msgstr "Rechte Muusknoop wohrt Köör"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:440
msgid "If checked, right clicking an item will select it, but will not unselect other, already selected items."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, söcht en Rechtsklick en Indrag ut, man köört dor keen anner, al utsöcht Indrääg bi af."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:442
msgid "Shift/Ctrl-Right mouse button selects"
msgstr "Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast un rechte Muustast söcht ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:443
msgid ""
"If checked, shift/ctrl right clicking will select items. \n"
"Note: This is meaningless if 'Right Button Selects' is checked."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Indrääg bi daalhollen Ümschalt-/Strg-Tast mit en Rechtsklick utsöcht.\n"
"Beacht: Dit deit nix, wenn \"Rechte Muusknoop söcht ut\" anmaakt is."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:445
msgid "Spacebar moves down"
msgstr "Freetast verschufft daal"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:446
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing the spacebar will select the current item and move down. \n"
"Otherwise, current item is selected, but remains the current item."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht de Freetast den aktuellen Indrag ut un verschufft den Blinker na nerrn.\n"
"Anners söcht de Freetast den aktuellen Indrag ut, man de Blinker blifft, woneem he is."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:448
msgid "Spacebar calculates disk space"
msgstr "Freetast reekt Plaatbruuk ut"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:449
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing the spacebar while the current item is a directory, will (except from selecting the directory) \n"
"calculate space occupied of the directory (recursively)."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt un de Blinker op en Orner steiht, reekt de Freetast, blang dat de Orner utsöcht warrt, rekursiev den Platz op de Fastplaat ut, den de Orner bruken deit."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:451
msgid "Insert moves down"
msgstr "Inföög-Tast verschufft na nerrn"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:452
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing INSERT will select the current item, and move down to the next item. \n"
"Otherwise, current item is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, söcht de Inföög-Tast den aktuellen Indrag ut un verschufft den Blinker na nerrn\n"
"op den nakamen Indrag. Anners warrt de aktuelle Indrag nich ännert."

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:454
msgid "Right clicking pops context menu immediately"
msgstr "Rechtsklick röppt fuurts dat Rechtklickmenü op"

#. +> trunk
#: krusader/Konfigurator/kglookfeel.cpp:455
msgid ""
"If checked, right clicking will result in an immediate showing of the context menu. \n"
"Otherwise, user needs to click and hold the right mouse button for 500ms."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, wiest en Rechtsklick direktemang dat Rechtsklickmenü.\n"
"Anners mutt de Bruker den rechten Muusknoop en halvig Sekunn daalhollen."

